    backlog:belongsToLineage bl:CodeAbundanceLineage ;
    rdfs:label "Every user-visible, glaring content-quality defect found by real screenshots is fixed and re-verified"@en ;
    backlog:hasGherkinText "Given code_abundance_page_v1_12_0.html opened in a real browser, When a reader looks at the header, the overview stats, the footer, and a principle's detail view, Then no LCWKB-subject text, no 'undefined' field, and no internally-inconsistent statistic (a table's real breakdown contradicting the summary number above it) appears anywhere in the visible UI. And When 0-error Playwright verification is re-run after the fix, Then it still holds." ;
