    backlog:soThat "the shipped artifact does not embarrass the package it represents -- direct user finding, quoted in this Story's own Evidence: 'the page is shameful.' A real, humbling gap in this session's own prior verification discipline: 0 console errors was repeatedly treated as sufficient evidence of correctness, when it only proves the JS didn't crash, not that the content it renders is right." ;
    backlog:pursuesObjective bl:ObjRDODIDefaultGatesPassing .

