    backlog:soThat "direct user finding, with the actual rendered content attached as evidence: raw ontology IDs stacked with every label made the menu unreadable, and the middle list was a genuine, previously-unrecognized second duplicate of the tree, distinct from the 'All Sections' block already removed. User explicitly asked for MS-Explorer style: iconized, short, readable." ;
