    backlog:hasVerificationMethod "Read the owner's own uploaded codelab_log.json directly rather than trusting the readable summary: all 4 real entries showed event:'codegen', 2 of which were genuinely agentTestGen's own attempts (confirmed by their task text matching the readable log's own Test-stage failure). Traced to 3 real call sites: agentTestGen's own direct codelabLog call (fixed to 'testgen'); processGeneratedCode's two codelabLog calls, shared by both manual Code Lab buttons (fixed to derive the label from the existing cardLabel parameter, no new parameter added); and the real ZIP-export consumer, updated to write either folder correctly rather than only ever writing codegen/. Verified via real Playwright, not read-and-assumed: called agentCodeGen then agentTestGen directly against a real mock server and confirmed CODELAB_LOG shows ['codegen','testgen'] in order; called processGeneratedCode directly with both real cardLabel values ('Code Generation Agent', 'Test Generation Agent') and confirmed the same correct pair. Re-ran the full 24-question regression suite: 24/24 passing, 0 console/page errors." .

