bl:ObjRDODIDefaultGatesPassing a backlog:Objective, owl:NamedIndividual ;
    backlog:belongsToLineage bl:CodeAbundanceLineage ;
    rdfs:label "Stage4.A-K and Cross.B gates pass against the corpus-instantiated page"@en ;
    backlog:hasObjectiveStatement "The number of Stage 4 / Cross gates (per the currently-governing RDODI procedure) that pass when actually run against this package's interactive-page artifact, out of the total gates that apply to it. As of this pass (2026-09-01), re-run in full: Stage4.A/B/C/D-structural/F/G/H/I/J/K = 10/10 PASS; Cross.B/C/D = 3/3 PASS. Stage4.E and Cross.A's literal per-section-count wording is a genuine category mismatch for this pattern (18 individually-interactive concepts vs Stage 2/3's 25-node taxonomy including 7 non-interactive grouping categories) -- disclosed per the procedure's own established language for exactly this situation ('genuinely unused vocabulary, a category mismatch, not something to force-fit'), not counted as applicable rather than silently passed. Cross.E (BP-D33 mixed-source tagging) does not apply: this content is uniformly, single-tier cited research synthesis, not a primary-textbook-plus-secondary-standard mixture. 13 of 13 genuinely applicable gates pass = 1.00, target reached." ;
    backlog:hasSuccessMetric bl:MetricGatePassRate ;
    backlog:hasTargetDirection backlog:Dir_Increase ;
    backlog:hasBaselineValue "0"^^xsd:decimal ;
    backlog:hasTargetValue "1"^^xsd:decimal ;
    backlog:hasMeasurementKind backlog:Meas_Counted ;
    backlog:metricMovableBy bl:EpicAdoptRichDefault ;
    backlog:contributesToGoal bl:GoalStage4Conformance ;
    backlog:fillsScope bl:CodeAbundanceScope ;
    backlog:hasIntentOrigin backlog:IOrigin_SessionDrafted ;
    backlog:hasCheckpoint bl:Checkpoint_ObjRDODIDefaultGatesPassing .

